# Outlook email pool example. Copy this file to `用于注册的邮箱.txt` (remove the .example suffix), one account per line.
# On startup the program automatically imports it into `用于注册的邮箱.json`, and accounts are claimed atomically in order during registration.
#
# 4 segment format (basic):
#   email----password----clientId----refreshToken
#
# 6 segment format (with recovery info, optional):
#   email----password----clientId----refreshToken----recoveryEmail----recoveryCode
#
# Note:
# - The separator is 4 consecutive hyphens (----), do not mix in ====
# - Lines starting with # are treated as comments and ignored
# - The email can be @outlook.com or @hotmail.com (the same Microsoft OAuth system)
# - clientId is the GUID of the Microsoft app registration, and refreshToken is an offline refresh token


# Example (values are placeholders, replace with real credentials):
example1@hotmail.com----PasswordA----00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000----M.C5xx_BAY.0.U.MsaArtifacts.-FAKE_REFRESH_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
example2@outlook.com----PasswordB----00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000----M.C5xx_BAY.0.U.MsaArtifacts.-FAKE_REFRESH_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER_yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy
